     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Questionnaire ANCA</b></p><a name=\"ANCA\"> </a><a name=\"hcANCA\"> </a><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"xhtTableBorder1\"><tr class=\"xhtRowBorder2\"><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"The linkID for the item\">LinkID</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Text for the item\">Text</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Minimum and Maximum # of times the item can appear in the instance\">Cardinality</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"The type of the item\">Type</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Additional information about the item\">Description &amp; Constraints</a><span style=\"float: right\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/></a></span></th></tr><tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_q_root.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"QuestionnaireRoot\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> ANCA</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">The registration process performed to identify and register a pregnant woman so that she can proceed to the antenatal care cons